        "message": "docs: record R6 transfer technical adjudication (D-056)\n\nControl-plane documentation only. No scientific execution, no comparator, contract\nor threshold change, no candidate processing, no seal advancement, no BRIDGE edit,\nno local evidence artifact modified.\n\nArchitect disposition PASS_ARCHITECT_R1_R6_TRANSFER_TECHNICAL_ADJUDICATION_R1.\n\nNo validation session is invalidated; no exclusion, replacement or rerun is\njustified. modeled_frame_fraction breaches in slots 03/05/07/08 are mechanically\nrecording-length only: the metric equals 1 - 3/N exactly across all 28 corpus and\nvalidation sessions and the corpus lower bound corresponds exactly to N = 26946.\nB2 breaches in slots 03/05 reflect elevated but fully accounted timestamp-gap\nburden, not corruption. B1 breaches in slots 07/08 establish genuine held-out\nrepresentation shift. The 8/8 low occupied-state pattern is genuine transfer\nsignal, not duration, evaluator error or a pooled-versus-single-invocation\nartifact. Bout-duration and top-1 breaches occur only in the concentration\ndirection. No software or instrument failure is established.\n\nSupporting evidence, protected golden-host local, not repository-accessible:\nTRANSFER_ADJUDICATION_COMPARISON_R1.json\n92d8e2155a88829b2509c78ac99211e2fa54d2fd558206975132db98f526bd87;\nTIER_B_TIER_C_EVALUATOR_R1.py\n3f331101d937e8c3cd0fc4162fe9cfe62fae752ffb10d9e9272322a8d5d6961e;\nadversarial review bundle\nf69c94219805c53f1b92775953b0a86493dbdc35a88f8abd135173b4d0b77f66.\n\nFinal PASS_REAL_SESSION_PRODUCTION_VALIDATION remains HOLD, pending Tier-A\nper-session qualitative dispositions and the Tier-D blinded domain-scientist\nreview.\n\nFiles changed: ai/DECISIONS.md with D-056 appended, and ai/CURRENT_STATE.md with\nthe 2026-08-18 transfer technical adjudication checkpoint added. D-051 through\nD-055 and all historical sections are not rewritten.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
